  "prompt": "For stores NL-01 and NL-02, show each month from January to June 2025 (UTC order dates) with the store's net revenue that month and its 3-month moving average: the average monthly revenue of that month and the 2 months before it, rounded to 2 decimals. Each store has a row for every month of the range, and a month with no orders counts as 0. Only January to June count, so January and February have fewer than 3 months to average: show how many months each average covers in months_in_window. Return store_code, month (the first day of the month), revenue_eur, avg_revenue_3m and months_in_window. Any row order is fine.",
